<h2>What does Blokada cost?</h2>
<p><a href="/download/">Blokada 5</a> for Android is free. Blokada 6, Blokada Family and Blokada Plus need a subscription. Each starts with a 7 day free trial, and you can get a refund within 7 days of paying.</p>
<p>Prices differ by country and store. The App Store, Google Play or the web dashboard shows the exact price before you pay.</p>

